{"id":"azotea","lemma":"azotea","pos":"noun","rank":4638,"glosses":["roof terrace, rooftop, flat roof","bonce, noggin (human head)"],"ipa":"/aθoˈtea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"azoteas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-azotea.wav","examples":[{"text":"Están mal de la azotea.","en":"They're insane.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441231","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tom está en la azotea.","en":"Tom is on the roof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799020","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"El ascensor no sube a la azotea.","en":"The elevator doesn't go up to the roof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/436998","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"elevator, lift"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"El ascensor no llega hasta la azotea.","en":"The elevator doesn't go up to the roof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/436997","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"elevator, lift"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"until"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Cuando era un niño pasaba mucho tiempo jugando en la azotea de mi casa.","en":"As a child, I spent a lot of time playing on our rooftop terrace.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"child, boy"},{"g":"to pass","l":"pasar"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to play","l":"jugar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"}]}]}